# The end of a race and back to the menu (docs/port/SYNTH.md 2): one player retires from a single race through the
# pause screen's quit, then _EndGame (0x1000000), the results (0x2000000), the game over screen (0x800000), where UP
# goes from its first option to Quit and A takes it: state 4 with gSkipToGameState 0x10, which passes on to the main
# menu (0x10). (gRace 2's time limit would end a race by itself too, once the car has stopped: with the cartridge's
# car physics it doesn't.)
# until: 0x800000:300
# seconds: 120
# visits: 0x2000000 0x800000 0x4
# expect: state=0x00000010: players 1, windows 1
5 A            # the controller pak warning
8 START        # the start prompt
11 A           # the main menu: the race
14 A           # the player screen
17 A           # the mode screen: a single race
20 A           # the track select: track 0
23 A           # the car select; the race from 27 s
30 START       # pause
31 UP 0.1      # its last item, quit
32 A           # are you sure?
33 RIGHT 0.1   # yes
34 A           # retired: the results, then the game over screen from about 37 s
40 UP 0.1      # the game over screen: Quit
42 A
